# Release-signing identity — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH (P2b-2b).
#
# Both verify surfaces consume these values so the image-signature gate (CI,
# cosign verify) and the in-binary catalog verifier (Go, officialSigstore*
# constants in release_catalog_sigstore.go) can never drift:
#   - CI sources this file for `cosign verify --certificate-*` (image-sig gate).
#   - TestReleaseIdentitySSOT asserts these EXACTLY equal the Go constants.
#
# PUBLIC identity policy only — issuer + SAN regex (RE2). No secrets.
# The SAN is pinned to a tagged release of THIS repo's ci.yml signing workflow;
# renaming ci.yml needs a coordinated update here + the Go constant + an overlap
# window (see docs/operator/sigstore-trusted-root-lifecycle.md).
CULVERT_RELEASE_SIGSTORE_ISSUER=https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
CULVERT_RELEASE_SIGSTORE_SAN_REGEX=^https://github\.com/KidCarmi/Culvert/\.github/workflows/ci\.yml@refs/tags/v.*$
